                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3143' id='19' type-v2='text' w='11499' x='87834' y='4604'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>#pd-data-marketing</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='89396' id='24' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='10033'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>All MAU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total count of unique active users on the platform in a given month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>All MAU YoY:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The year-over-year percentage change in the total monthly active users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of unique monthly active users who interacted with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of total monthly active users that interacted with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>All Order Count</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total number of orders placed across the entire platform in a month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Frequency</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The average number of orders per active user in a given month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname=' Tableau Bold'>All Orders YoY</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname=' Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The year-over-year percentage change in the total number of orders.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>All Disco Order Count</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total number of orders generated through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Order %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of all orders that were generated by the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Total Acquisition:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total number of new users who made their first-ever purchase in a given month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Acquisition % MAU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of the month&apos;s active users who were new acquisitions.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Acquisition YoY</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The year-over-year percentage change in the total number of acquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Acquisition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of new users acquired specifically through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Acquisition Share</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all new users that were acquired through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Total Reactivations</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of previously inactive users who returned and made a purchase.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Reactivation % MAU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the month&apos;s active users who were reactivated users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Reactivation YoY</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The year-over-year percentage change in the number of reactivated users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Reactivations</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of users reactivated specifically through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Reactivation %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all reactivated users who came from the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>HVA Reactivations</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of reactivated users who who came from the HVA.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>HVA Reactivation %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all reactivated users who came from the HVA.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Reacquisition: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The number of users who returned to make a purchase after a longer period of inactivity than &quot;Reactivations&quot;.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Reacquisition % MAU: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of the month&apos;s active users who were reacquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Reacquisition YoY:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The year-over-year percentage change in the number of reacquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Reacquisition:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of users reacquired specifically through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Reacquisition %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all reacquired users who came from the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Retention:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of existing users from the previous month who remained active and made a purchase in the current month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Retention %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the month&apos;s active users who were retained users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Retention YoY: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The year-over-year percentage change in the number of retained users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Retention:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The number of retained users who interacted with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Retention %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all retained users who interacted with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Acquisition %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s monthly active users who were new users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Existing %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s MAU who were not new users (i.e., retained, reactivated, or reacquired).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Retained %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s MAU who were retained users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Reactivation %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s MAU who were reactivated users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Winback %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s MAU who were returning users (combining Reactivations and Reacquisitions).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco MAU Breakdown - Reacquisition %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the Disco campaign&apos;s MAU who were reacquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Acquisition %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of newly acquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Disco Acquisition %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users newly acquired through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - NonDisco Acquisition %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users newly acquired through channels other than the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Reacquisition %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of reacquired users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Disco Reacquisition %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users reacquired through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - NonDisco Reacquisition %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users reacquired through channels other than the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Reactivation %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of reactivated users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Disco Reactivation %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users reactivated through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - NonDisco Reactivation %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of users reactivated through channels other than the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Retention %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of retained users.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - Disco Retention %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of retained users who interacted with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>MAU Breakdown - NonDisco Retention %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of the platform&apos;s total MAU that consists of retained users who did not interact with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco AOV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The Average Order Value for orders generated through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Platform AOV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The Average Order Value for all orders across the platform.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco AOV / Platform AOV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The ratio of the Disco campaign&apos;s AOV compared to the overall platform AOV.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco AFV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The Average Food Value for orders generated through the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Platform AFV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The Average Food Value for all orders across the platform.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco AFV / Platform AFV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The ratio of the Disco campaign&apos;s AFV compared to the overall platform AFV.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Frequency:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The average number of orders placed by users who engaged with the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>1 Timers % MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of monthly active users who placed exactly one order during the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>2-3 Timers % MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of monthly active users who placed two to three orders during the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>4-5 Timers % MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of monthly active users who placed four to five orders during the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>5+ Timers % MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of monthly active users who placed five or more orders during the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Total Sessions:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total number of user sessions on the platform in a month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>CVR %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The Conversion Rate, or the percentage of sessions that resulted in an order.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Vendor Sessions:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total number of sessions attributed to vendors participating in the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco Vendor Sessions %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of all platform sessions that are attributed to vendors in the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Disco DH Spend:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The total DH spend on the Disco campaign.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Must Have Spend: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The portion of Disco campaign spend allocated to essential or high-priority vendors.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Volume Spend:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of Disco campaign spend focused on driving a high quantity of orders or traffic.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Growth Spend:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The portion of Disco campaign spend aimed at user acquisition or market expansion.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Rest Spend:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The remaining portion of Disco campaign spend not categorized as Must Have, Volume, or Growth.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Must Have Spend %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the total Disco campaign spend allocated to &quot;Must Have&quot; vendors.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Volume Spend %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The percentage of the total Disco campaign spend allocated to &quot;Volume&quot; vendors.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Growth Spend %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the total Disco campaign spend allocated to &quot;Growth&quot; vendors.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b91e9c' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Rest Spend %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The percentage of the total Disco campaign spend allocated to &quot;Rest&quot; vendors.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
